      Mercury:  g_N = 3.9575e-02 m/s^2,  g_N/a0 = 4.228e+08,  f_threshold = sqrt(a0/g_N) = 4.863e-05,  min |dg/g_N| at f=f_Cassini = 3.713e-05
       Saturn:  g_N = 6.5197e-05 m/s^2,  g_N/a0 = 6.966e+05,  f_threshold = sqrt(a0/g_N) = 1.198e-03,  min |dg/g_N| at f=f_Cassini = 1.187e-03
  a0 footing: repo alt      1.13e-10
      Mercury:  g_N = 3.9575e-02 m/s^2,  g_N/a0 = 3.502e+08,  f_threshold = sqrt(a0/g_N) = 5.344e-05,  min |dg/g_N| at f=f_Cassini = 4.194e-05
       Saturn:  g_N = 6.5197e-05 m/s^2,  g_N/a0 = 5.770e+05,  f_threshold = sqrt(a0/g_N) = 1.317e-03,  min |dg/g_N| at f=f_Cassini = 1.305e-03
